# Registry Modification of MS-settings Protocol Handler | T1112, T1546.001, T1548.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_registry_modification_of_ms_setting_protocol_handler.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (((Image="*\\reg.exe" OR OriginalFileName="reg.exe") CommandLine="*add*") OR ((Image IN ("*\\powershell.exe", "*\\pwsh.exe") OR OriginalFileName IN ("powershell.exe", "pwsh.dll")) (CommandLine IN ("*New-ItemProperty*", "*Set-ItemProperty*", "*ni *", "*sp *")))) CommandLine="*\\ms-settings\\shell\\open\\command*"
